  <div class="w-embed"></div><div class="hero3" style="opacity:0"><div class="hero-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="hero-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-13bfe0acd738c0.jpg"/></div><div class="hero-image-overlay"></div><div class="hero-content-wrapper"><div class="hero-content" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle light">Suite Pétanque</div><h1 class="light">The scent of lavender in the air, he knew this was more than just a game..</h1></div></div></div><div class="room-subhero-section"><div class="container"><div class="banner"><div class="collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="banner-collection-list w-dyn-items w-row" role="list"><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-703a04f1108111.svg"/><p class="faq-question-title">Garden View</p></div></div><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-73300bb374405d.png"/><p class="faq-question-title">Outdoor area</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-halves"><div class="main-content"><p class="feature-paragraph smaller">Queen Size Suite - 2 people max -40 m2</p><h3>Suite Pétanque</h3><p>Suite Pétanque set within a beautifully renovated residence, offers more space than our smallest category, complete with a living area, a terrace with sun loungers, and a tranquil setting to unwind</p><p class="italics">Choose this one if you love the perfect blend of timeless charm and modern style</p><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button w-button" href="https://app.mews.com/distributor/150bd326-7c63-4a24-b668-abcf00c6bb22" target="_blank">Check Now</a></div></div><div class="secondary-content"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-items w-row" role="list"><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Garden View</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="full-frame-slider-wrapper"><div class="full-frame-slider w-slider" data-animation="cross" data-autoplay="true" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-delay="4000" data-disable-swipe="false" data-duration="500" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-infinite="true" data-nav-spacing="3"><div class="slider-mask w-slider-mask"><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-8c03274d5f9fd2.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-56008e84cc17e5.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-66ca2deea79e96.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-839760206000c1.jpg"/></div></div></div><div class="left-arrow w-slider-arrow-left"><img alt="arrow left" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-62e87937b486a8.svg"/></div><div class="right-arrow w-slider-arrow-right"><img alt="arrow right" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-7d7a86fb467f08.svg"/></div><div class="slide-nav w-slider-nav w-slider-nav-invert w-round"></div></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="grid-layout"><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper left-padding right-padding"><p class="feature-paragraph">With its 40m2, its sunny terrace and its openings onto nature, the Pétanque suite is an ode to the art of living in the South. Simple and authentic luxury, Provençal style. Here, there's nothing superfluous: every object has its place, every detail tells a story.</p></div><div class="divider _144px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper medium-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-e203e7177a0fba.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>The Pétanque Suite offers a peaceful refuge surrounded by pine trees. Here, time slows down, the song of cicadas accompanies you, and the shade of a pine tree invites you to take a nap.</p></div></div></div><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper" data-w-id="9a2292a3-c1f2-9dae-ff8c-1931746eb56b"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed small-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-bac76ca47948f6.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>Nestled beneath the pine trees, the suite feels like a small vacation home in Provence. Large bay windows, southern light, and a bag of pétanque balls: the Mediterranean art of living.</p></div></div><div class="divider _96px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper right-padding" data-w-id="9a2292a3-c1f2-9dae-ff8c-1931746eb577"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed large-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-229821379c1145.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"><p>A subtle harmony between art, nature, and modern comfort. Every detail has been designed to encourage slowing down, breathing, and enjoying.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section padding-96 w-condition-invisible" style="background-color:#e2ded5"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper width-small centered"><p class="feature-paragraph">Our inviting Suites are all different, which makes them unique.</p><p>Example of Suite layout.<br/>(plans are indicative and non binding)</p></div><img alt="" class="w-dyn-bind-empty" loading="lazy" src="data:text/html; charset=utf-8;base64,"/></div></div><div class="section padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing div-block"><h2>Explore other Suites</h2></div></div><div class="rooms-collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="room-flex-thirds w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="penequet.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Villa du Pénéquet" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-5f8a45f5b552ed.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Villa du Pénéquet</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="bronzette.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite de la Bronzette" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-8626fb58027da5.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite de la Bronzette</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/asse