src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="room-link-block w-inline-block" href="suiteaartiste.html"><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite de l'Artiste" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-e1708f1e9761a9.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite de l'Artiste</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div><div class="room-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a aria-current="page" class="room-link-block w-inline-block w--current" href="."><div class="collection-image-wrapper"><img alt="Suite Pétanque" class="image-cover" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-833a78c568fe35.jpg"/></div><div class="collection-content-wrapper"><div class="subtitle italics">Suite Pétanque</div><img alt="" class="collection-arrow-img hide" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-a926ac09f8f7bc.svg"/></div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="section bg-color-2 hide"><div class="container"><div class="cta-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid cta-3-grid"><div class="cta-area-1" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af06-f049af02"><p>Get our emails. News about Toile Blanche, offers, special dishes from the chef’s table and much more. Not too often — Just enough.</p></div><div class="cta-area-2" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af09-f049af02"><h3>Don't be a stranger!</h3></div><div class="cta-area-3" id="w-node-a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af0c-f049af02"><div class="newsletter-form-block w-form"><form class="newsletter-form" data-name="Newsletter Form" data-wf-element-id="a924dcd2-d5c0-7326-f66e-1c36f049af0e" data-wf-page-id="63df93af2ae9b05e81d58233" id="wf-form-Newsletter-Form" method="get" name="wf-form-Newsletter-Form"><div class="newsletter-input"><label for="Full-Name">Name</label>